        "text": "theorem preparedWitness_exists (F : OutgoingProfile.Profile) (hP : 2 ≤ F.data.core.P)\n    (hh : F.data.h ≤ 1 / 1000) (N : ℕ) (hN : 1 ≤ N)\n    {delta : ℝ} (hdelta : 0 < delta) (radiusFloor : ℝ) :\n    Nonempty (PreparedWitness F N delta radiusFloor)"
